<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ariad Pharma said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ariad Pharma said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co started coverage of Ariad Pharmaceuticals Inc with a buy rating, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 6-13/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
